---
import Layout from '@estate/ui/PortfolioLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
const p=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const nav=[{label:'Markets',href:'#markets'},{label:'Approach',href:'#approach'},{label:'Calculator',href:'#calculator'},{label:'Find your fit',href:'#qualification'}];
const markets=[
{label:'01 / THE EMIRATES',name:'Dubai',copy:'A diverse mix of ready residences and new development concepts.',tag:'Income + lifestyle',image:'market-dubai.webp'},
{label:'02 / SOUTHERN EUROPE',name:'Lisbon',copy:'A mature urban landscape with local rules and distinct ownership costs.',tag:'Long-term perspective',image:'market-lisbon.webp'},
{label:'03 / THE UK',name:'London',copy:'Established international demand, high acquisition costs and multiple submarkets.',tag:'Capital preservation focus',image:'market-london.webp'}];
const sampleScenes=[
{name:'Coastal residence concept',market:'Dubai · illustrative',image:'opportunity-coast.webp',description:'An imagined waterfront home demonstrating the visual presentation of a private residence.'},
{name:'Garden living concept',market:'International · illustrative',image:'opportunity-garden.webp',description:'A fictional landscaped home showing an alternative residential lifestyle.'},
{name:'Modern architecture concept',market:'International · illustrative',image:'opportunity-city.webp',description:'A sample architectural study for buyers who prioritize contemporary design.'}
];
const endpoint=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LEAD_ENDPOINT || '';
---
<Layout title="NORTHLINE Advisory | International Property Investment — Demo" description="Illustrative international property advisory website with suitability quiz and net yield calculator. Fictional business and examples." brand="NORTHLINE / ADVISORY" nav={nav} accent="#101d31">
<section class="hero container">
 <div class="hero-text"><p class="eyebrow">INTERNATIONAL REAL ESTATE / DEMO</p><h1>Explore more. <em>Imagine beyond.</em></h1><p class="hero-lead">Discover distinct places and the kinds of homes that define them. Compare investment considerations without losing sight of the lifestyle behind each decision.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#qualification">Build your brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-button" href="#calculator">Explore the numbers <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="hero-note">This is a fictional advisory concept. Nothing shown is financial advice or an offer.</p></div>
 <figure class="hero-photo"><img src={`${p}assets/advisory-residence.webp`} alt="Original AI-generated fictional coastal residence and skyline at sunset; not a real property listing" width="1380" height="777" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async"/><figcaption><span>ARCHITECTURAL CONCEPT</span><span>ILLUSTRATIVE / NOT A REAL PROPERTY</span></figcaption></figure>
</section>
<section class="market-section" id="markets"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / PLACES TO EXPLORE</p><h2>Different places. <em>Different considerations.</em></h2><p>Every market has different taxes, ownership rules, liquidity and recurring costs. These cards are illustrative, not recommendations.</p></div><div class="market-grid">{markets.map(m=><article class="market-card"><img src={`${p}assets/${m.image}`} alt={`Original AI-generated architectural visualization representing the ${m.name} concept market; no actual listing`} width="836" height="470" loading="lazy"/><div class="market-copy"><span class="eyebrow">{m.label}</span><h3>{m.name}</h3><p>{m.copy}</p><span class="market-tag">{m.tag}</span></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="opportunities-section container" id="opportunities" aria-labelledby="opportunities-heading">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / AN EDITORIAL COLLECTION</p><h2 id="opportunities-heading">Homes that tell <em>different stories.</em></h2><p>Three original visual studies illustrating residential styles. These are not available properties or verified investment recommendations.</p></div>
  <div class="opportunities-grid">{sampleScenes.map((item)=><article class="opportunity-photo-card"><img src={`${p}assets/${item.image}`} alt={`AI-generated fictional architecture study: ${item.name}; not real property inventory`} width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="opportunity-photo-copy"><span>{item.market}</span><h3>{item.name}</h3><p>{item.description}</p></div></article>)}</div>
</section>
<section id="approach" class="logic-section container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">03 / THE APPROACH</p><h2>Start with the objective,<br><em>not a property.</em></h2></div><div class="logic-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Define the role of capital</h3><p>Income, long-term appreciation, personal use or a mix. Different goals call for different criteria.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Stress-test the economics</h3><p>Allow for vacancy, ongoing costs, financing, transaction fees, and currency exposure.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Make trade-offs explicit</h3><p>Compare readiness, geography, time horizon and liquidity rather than relying on headline yields.</p></article></div></section>
<section id="calculator" class="calculator-section"><div class="container calculator-layout"><div class="calculator-copy"><p class="eyebrow">04 / INVESTMENT CALCULATOR</p><h2>What is left <em>after costs?</em></h2><p>Adjust the assumptions to see how occupancy and ongoing expenses change an illustrative income-based yield.</p><p class="callout">This model excludes purchase taxes, financing, capital gains, appreciation, exit costs and currency changes. No return is guaranteed.</p></div><div class="calculator-card"><div class="card-head"><strong>Rental scenario</strong><span>Illustrative only</span></div><div class="calc-input-grid"><label>Purchase price (USD)<input type="number" min="1" max="1000000000" step="1000" value="450000" data-calc="price"/></label><label>Annual gross rent (USD)<input type="number" min="0" max="1000000000" step="500" value="31500" data-calc="rent"/></label><label>Annual service charges (USD)<input type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="100" value="3600" data-calc="service"/></label><label>Annual management costs (USD)<input type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="100" value="2400" data-calc="management"/></label><label class="wide">Annual occupancy: <output id="occupancy-value">90%</output><input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="90" data-calc="occupancy" /></label></div><div class="calc-results" aria-live="polite"><div><span>Gross yield</span><strong id="gross-yield">7.0%</strong></div><div><span>Estimated net yield</span><strong id="net-yield">4.97%</strong></div><div><span>Estimated net income / year</span><strong id="net-income">$22,350</strong></div></div><p class="fine">Annual net income = rental income × occupancy − service charges − management costs. Net yield = annual net income ÷ purchase price.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="qualification" class="quiz-section container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">05 / INVESTOR BRIEF</p><h2>Find the questions worth <em>asking next.</em></h2><p>Seven simple steps produce an illustrative shortlist from fictional example opportunities. No matching algorithm guarantees suitability.</p></div><div class="quiz-shell" data-quiz><div class="quiz-sidebar"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR BRIEF</p><div class="progress-label"><span>STEP <strong data-progress-label>01 / 07</strong></span><span data-percent>14%</span></div><div class="progress-track"><span data-progress-bar style="width:14%"></span></div><p>Private by default. Your answers stay in the browser unless you explicitly send an enquiry to a configured operator.</p><div class="quiz-steps">Budget <span>→</span> Goal <span>→</span> Market <span>→</span> Delivery <span>→</span> Timeline <span>→</span> Financing <span>→</span> Contact</div></div><div class="quiz-main"><form id="investor-enquiry" data-capture-form data-endpoint={endpoint} method="post" action={`${p}api/lead`}><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></div>
  <fieldset data-quiz-step="0"><legend>What budget range are you considering?</legend><p class="step-sub">All figures in USD for illustrative comparison.</p><div class="options">{[['under-300k','Under $300,000'],['300-600k','$300,000–$600,000'],['600k-1m','$600,000–$1 million'],['over-1m','Above $1 million']].map(([v,l])=><label><input type="radio" name="budget" value={v}/><span>{l}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-quiz-step="1" hidden><legend>What is your primary investment objective?</legend><div class="options">{[['income','Rental income'],['growth','Long-term appreciation'],['diversify','Portfolio diversification'],['personal','Personal use and flexibility']].map(([v,l])=><label><input type="radio" name="objective" value={v}/><span>{l}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-quiz-step="2" hidden><legend>Which market is on your radar?</legend><div class="options">{[['dubai','Dubai'],['lisbon','Lisbon'],['london','London'],['open','I am open to markets']].map(([v,l])=><label><input type="radio" name="market" value={v}/><span>{l}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-quiz-step="3" hidden><legend>What delivery status do you prefer?</legend><div class="options">{[['ready','Ready / resale'],['offplan','Under construction'],['both','Open to both']].map(([v,l])=><label><input type="radio" name="status" value={v}/><span>{l}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-quiz-step="4" hidden><legend>When might you make a decision?</legend><div class="options">{[['now','Within 3 months'],['soon','3–12 months'],['later','Over 12 months'],['research','Only researching']].map(([v,l])=><label><input type="radio" name="timeline" value={v}/><span>{l}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-quiz-step="5" hidden><legend>How would you fund the purchase?</legend><div class="options">{[['cash','Cash'],['loan','Financing'],['mixed','Cash + financing'],['unknown','Undecided']].map(([v,l])=><label><input type="radio" name="financing" value={v}/><span>{l}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-quiz-step="6" hidden><legend>Your example shortlist is almost ready.</legend><p class="step-sub">Contact details are optional for viewing results, but required to send an enquiry.</p><div class="contact-grid"><label>Name <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" minlength="2" required placeholder="Your name"/></label><label>Email <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"/></label><label>Phone (optional) <input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+1 555 000 0000"/></label></div><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent"/> <span>I agree to be contacted if I submit this enquiry. <a href={`${p}privacy/`}>Privacy notice</a>.</span></label></fieldset>
  <div class="quiz-error" role="alert" aria-live="polite" data-quiz-error></div><div class="quiz-controls"><button type="button" class="back" data-back hidden>← Back</button><button type="button" class="next" data-next>Continue <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div>
  <div data-quiz-results hidden class="quiz-results" aria-live="polite"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR EXAMPLE OPTIONS</p><h3>Three directions to explore</h3><p data-brief-summary></p><div data-example-options></div><p class="fine">Examples are hypothetical and not property listings, offers or investment advice.</p><button type="submit" class="button submit-button">Send an enquiry (demo) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p data-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
 </form></div></div></section>
</Layout>
<script>import '../scripts/investor.ts';</script>
